		AMD Versal Board Support Package


Table of Contents
=================

1. Supported Boards
2. Change History
3. BSP Features
4. BSP Notes


1. Supported Boards
===================

This BSP supports the following boards:

  + AMD Versal VCK190 REV 1.0/1.1
  + AMD Versal VMK180 REV 1.0/1.1


2. Change History
=================

  - 2025/11 (LINUXPG-2799): Wind River Linux LTS25 RCPL3: Add BSP support for Versal VCK190 based on
			   Xilinx SDK 2025.01
  - 2025/11 (LINUXPG-2800): Wind River Linux LTS25 RCPL3: Add BSP support for Versal VMK180 based on
			   Xilinx SDK 2025.01

3. BSP Features
===============

3.1 Supported Features
----------------------

The following BSP features are validated and supported on boards where
the corresponding h/w features exist.

  o CPU
	+ VCK190: Xilinx Versal ACAP XCVC1902
	+ VMK180: Xilinx Versal ACAP XCVM1802

  o Memory
	+ DDR: 8GB DDR4 (1 x MTA9ADF1G72AZ)
	+ LPDDR: 8GB LPDDR4 (4 x MT53D512M32D2DS)

  o Bus
	+ I2C: On-Chip I2C Controller (Only i2c@ff030000)
	+ QuadSPI: On-Chip Quad-SPI controller
	+ USB 2.0: DWC3 USB Controller

  o Network
	+ CANFD: On-CHip CANFD controller
	+ Ethernet: GEM MAC
		+ PHY: TI DP83867ISRGZ Ethernet SGMII PHY

  o Storage
	+ QSPI NOR Flash: 2x1Gb MT25QU01GBBB8E112 (X-EBM-01 daughter card)
	+ SD/MMC: On-Chip SD/SDIO/eMMC Controller
	+ EEPROM: M24128-BR

  o Power Mgmt
	+ CPU Hotplug
	+ CPU Frequency
	+ CPU IDLE:
		+ WFI
		+ cpu-sleep-0
	+ Suspend/Resume:
		+ Suspend: Suspend-to-RAM
		+ Resume: RTC/Serial Wakeup Source

  o Misc Devices
	+ GPIO: PMC GPIO Controller
	+ RTC: On-Chip Real Time Clock
	+ UART: On-Chip UART Controller
	+ DMA Engine: LPD DMA Controller
	+ FPGA: FPGA Manager
	+ SYSMON: PMBUS Monitor INA226
	+ Watchdog: System Watchdog

3.2 Unsupported Features
------------------------

The following features are not supported and not validated:

  x Counter: Triple-timer counter (TTC)
  x IOMMU: SMMU Memory Management (SMMU-500)
  x PCIe Endpoint 8-lane edge connector
  x I2C: i2c@ff020000 I2C Controller
  x RNG: Versal TRNG
  x FMC: FMC+ Connector (PL-side)
  x HDMI: HDMI RX/TX Connector (PL-side)
  x GEM IEEE 1588
  x zQSFP connector (PL-side)
  x zSFP/zSFP+ (1x2 stacked) connector (PL-side)
  x AI Engine
  x EDAC: Xilinx DDR ECC controller
  x GPIO: PMC GPIO Controller

4. BSP Notes
============

4.1 Validated Board Info
------------------------

This BSP is only validated in following environment. If you use this BSP
in a different environment it may possibly have some issues.

VCK190:
	Processor:              Versal VC1902
	Board Revision:	        EK-VCK190-G-ED
	BootLoader:             U-Boot
	BootLoader Version:     U-Boot 2025.01

VMK180:
	Processor:              Versal VM1802
	Board Revision:	        EK-VMK180-G-ED
	BootLoader:             U-Boot
	BootLoader Version:     U-Boot 2025.01
